On-screen keyboard layouts
==========================

The *.json files in this directory are GNOME Shell's on-screen keyboard
layouts, copied unchanged from gnome-shell's data/osk-layouts/
(https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell, main branch, commit
7fcbec8013686024aca572b2bcdbc8102fdef18a):

  us.json uk.json de.json fr.json es.json it.json
  digits.json number.json phone.json email.json url.json

GNOME Shell is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2
or later (gnome-shell's COPYING), the same license as GNOME Shell Plus's
panel (GPL-2.0-or-later). Copyright the GNOME Shell contributors.

According to gnome-shell's history (commit 52a779e4, "data: Add keyboard
layout JSON files"), the layouts were originally generated with
cldr2json (git://repo.or.cz/cldr2json.git) from the Android keyboard
layouts in the Unicode CLDR keyboard data
(http://www.unicode.org/Public/cldr/latest/keyboards.zip), which is
available under the Unicode License; they have since been edited by GNOME
Shell contributors.

To add a layout, copy it from gnome-shell's data/osk-layouts/ and list it
in panel/src/osk/layout.rs.
